    "Id": "mechdef_smilodon_SMI-3",
    "Name": "Smilodon 3",
    "Details": "The Smilodon 3 combines two Improved PPCs for consistent energy projection with two Mech-Scale Grenade Launchers and a pair of Rocketstorm 90 launchers, unguided dual-salvo systems designed to saturate AMS defenses through raw volume. It adds two Improved SRM-6 racks for mid-range punch, an Improved Large Pulse Laser for efficient close assault, and two Early Clan ER Small Lasers for point-blank engagement. A Guardian ECM bolsters electronic protection, and the PHI Suite enables lance-wide targeting synchronization. This variant emphasizes saturation and mixed-range suppression, excelling in chaotic close-range skirmishes where layered firepower can overwhelm defenders.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - PPC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.32</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_smilodon"
  },
